Simulated example datasets for test runs. All data are simulated as described in the corresponding paper.

Under an outcome prevalence of 0.2% and 4 transcripts, we provide example datasets for three scenarios:
    1. NULL: none of the transcripts contains causal variants.
        simrep1_S0_30.gds, simrep1_S0_30_group.RData, pheno_S0_30_1.tsv.
    
    2. 60% of causal variants are assigned to the canonical transcript.
        simrep1_S2_30_0.6.gds, simrep1_S2_30_0.6_group.RData, pheno_S2_30_0.6_1.tsv.

    3. The canonical transcript contains all causal variants.
        simrep1_S0_30_1.gds, simrep1_S0_30_1_group.RData, pheno_S0_30_1_1.tsv



